# Well known servers, always written first and never dropped by ranking.
#
# loongarchlinux.lcpu.dev is the endpoint on the port maintainers' own domain.
# The other five, in mirrors/loong64.pool, are the rest of the list the port
# ships as pacman-mirrorlist-loong64, and all six served the same 90776 byte
# core.db when this file was written.
#
# It is also the anchor because it serves a plain directory index, which
# scripts/check-keyring-pin has to read. mirrors.pku.edu.cn answers 200 for a
# directory with a JavaScript page instead, so a text scan of it finds nothing.
Server = https://loongarchlinux.lcpu.dev/loongarch/archlinux/$repo/os/$arch
